{"id":"vela","lemma":"vela","pos":"noun","rank":2333,"glosses":["candle","third wheel"],"ipa":"/ˈvɛ.lɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"velas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-vela.wav","examples":[{"text":"Segure a vela.","en":"Hold the candle.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/470362","words":[{"g":"to hold","l":"segurar"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"Eu vejo que você comprou velas.","en":"I see you bought candles.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"ver"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to buy","l":"comprar"},null]},{"text":"Dê-me essa vela.","en":"Give me that candle.","words":[{"g":"to transfer one’s…","l":"dar"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"that, that one","l":"esse"},null]},{"text":"Acenda as velas.","en":"Light the candles.","words":[{"g":"to light","l":"acender"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Eu apaguei a vela.","en":"I blew the candle out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/535557","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to put out","l":"apagar"},{"g":"the / to"},null]}]}